  Build Environment:
------------------

- Ubuntu 20.04 64-bit


Change Log:
-----------

- UART boot source is now available
- EEPROM SOM detection for Ethernet PHY, SPI-NOR Flash, and RTC populated options
- TSN support for Ethernet
- Switched M.2 WiFi/Bluetooth module to Laird LWB5+
- Add Bluetooth support
- Default ALSA config to play and record audio with the phyBOARD-Lyra carrier-board
- Virtualization with Podman/Docker


Issues Fixed:
-------------

- USB support in U-Boot


Known Issues:
-------------

- The flashcp command occasionally fails during the verification step.
- The reboot command delays the reboot process by several seconds in 3% of all boots.
- Read/write performance on the USB-C connector can drop sometimes.
- WiFi is currently not working due missing support for the 3rd MMC interface.
